WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:02.880
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.950
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.500
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.190
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.620
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:14.930
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.800
When we arrived in the Disc Zone,

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.770
Kiriha and Blastmon were in 
the middle of a fierce battle.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:25.940
It caused the collapse of the Zone.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.040
But Kiriha ignored our persuasion

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.610
and left the Zone, 
abandoning all the Digimon

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.210
that he could have saved.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:45.410
<b>Shoutmon and the Proof of a King!</b>

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:42.540
Shoutmon and the Proof of a King!

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:49.900
It's hopeless!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.460
The Zone is collapsing!

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.820
We have no choice.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:56.200
Let's take all the Digimon and 
retreat to the Shinobi Zone.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:56.770
Yeah.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:17.290
Returning here was a good decision.

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:22.190
We will shelter the Digimon 
of the Disc Zone here.

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:24.180
Thank you, Elder.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.000
You can all live here for now.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.600
Xros Heart will keep fighting so we 
can restore the Disc Zone someday.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.070
R-Really?!

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:37.520
Oh, thank goodness!

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:40.140
<i>Taiki was right.</i>

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:44.010
<i>It's since they're weak that 
I can't turn my back on them!</i>

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:47.450
<i>I'd rather live in a world where the 
strong and weak help each other!</i>

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.460
<i>That's the kind of King I want to be.</i>

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.740
<i>I want to make the world 
Taiki desires a reality.</i>

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:54.630
<i>But...</i>

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.200
<i>I won't let anyone 
interfere in my fight.</i>

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.420
<i>You have neither the strength nor 
the spirit to maintain a DigiXros.</i>

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:05.240
<i>You are not fit to be the central 
support for your allies.</i>

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.980
<i>Wh-What's going on?</i>

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.390
<i>X4K!</i>

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.650
To help everyone recover,

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:30.150
tomorrow we will distribute the 
best DigiNoir in our storehouse.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.530
For real?! You're so generous, Elder!

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.700
We get to eat DigiNoir again, Brother!

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.890
Isn't that great, guys?

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:38.440
Yes!

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:40.570
DigiNoir! DigiNoir!

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.590
DigiNoir!

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.180
DigiNoir!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:53.900
Okay...

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.350
Hey, hey...

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.730
Get up.

00:02:58.340 --> 00:02:59.160
Huh?

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.230
So sleepy...

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.620
Taiki! Taiki!

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:33.790
Wisemon? What is it, at this hour?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.440
I was just investigating Knightmon

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.220
and his companions in the Xros Loader,

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.200
and I found something surprising.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:45.000
Please examine everyone right away.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.280
Why?

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:49.440
I may have been too late...

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:58.380
Hey! There you are, Xros Heart!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.740
Blastmon!

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:00.590
But how?!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:04.790
He created a body double 
from shards of himself,

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:07.360
and he has the ability to 
transmit his mind into it.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.790
The shards from his crystal missiles

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.800
stuck to our bodies, and to 
the Digimon of the Disc Zone.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:16.160
That's right. Though it looks 
like the scrawny blond runt

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.140
figured it out and destroyed them.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:26.180
I will now crush you all!

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:28.290
And then my Code Crown total will be...

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.650
one, two, three, four... gah!

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.450
Well, it'll be a lot!

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:34.110
Everyone, we have to DigiXros!

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:36.130
Taiki, wait...

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.290
Idiot! This isn't the time to dawdle!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:39.520
Let's do it, Taiki!

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:40.490
Yeah!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.870
Shoutmon!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.170
Okay!

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.510
Ballistamon!

00:04:57.910 --> 00:04:59.110
Dorulumon!

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.400
Starmons!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.280
Yes!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.830
DigiXros!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.750
DigiXros!

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.380
Shoutmon X4!

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.630
What? He stopped it?

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:20.830
What's wrong, Brother? 
Are you still not feeling well?

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.810
Try harder! This shouldn't 
be a tough opponent for you!

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:29.940
Shoutmon X4!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.580
Beelzebumon! You came!

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.450
<i>Shoutmon's movements are 
sluggish. Could he be...</i>

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:43.080
All right, we need X4B!

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:46.590
Taiki, it'll be more effective 
to attack from two sides.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:51.800
Beelzebumon!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:53.900
Revolmon!

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.470
DigiXros!

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.300
DigiXros!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:04.780
What?!

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.580
Death the Cannon Spiral!

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:19.610
That spirally stuff is trying...

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:21.540
...to draw me...

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.410
...in!

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.370
This was just a double anyway!

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:31.660
The real me has already gone home!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.910
I promise you, I will 
find out where you are.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.780
Taiki, you must gather and 
destroy all the shards,

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.090
or there'll be more trouble.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:42.540
Blastmon will use them to 
identify the Zone we're in.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.070
Then leave the cleanup to us!

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:49.750
Be careful!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:57.680
All those Braun tubes... 
could that Zone be...

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:01.180
Looks like you're fighting a tough battle.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:02.230
I'm not telling.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.010
I'm sure most of your army is exhausted

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:08.320
after that battle with Blue Flare.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:11.980
I don't mind lending you 
some reinforcements.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.490
You don't get it, do you?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.580
My goal is to beat you, Tacty.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.100
I see. Then I pray for your success.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.640
What does that mean?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.800
We might be able to buy some time,

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:36.000
but I'm sure Blastmon will 
turn up sooner or later.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.500
I know.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.700
One per Digimon.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.720
Yay! DigiNoir!

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.660
More! More!

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.030
Shoutmon is acting strange?

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:13.520
Yeah. I think he's hiding something.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.000
He wasn't at his best 
in that fight, either.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.910
Well, it's only human to be a 
little off your game sometimes.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.410
Oh, wait, he's a Digimon...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.840
Did you just make a joke with yourself?

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.350
Oh! I get it!

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:30.780
Shoutmon's been sneaking 
DigiNoir at night!

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:33.190
That's why he hasn't been in top form!

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.190
Surely not...

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.540
I saw him!

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:36.850
Me, too!

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.700
You scared me!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.800
Don't just pop up out of nowhere 
like that, ChibiKamemon!

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.220
He was lurking around

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:45.600
the DigiNoir storehouse with 
Ballistamon last night.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:49.140
They've been sneaking DigiNoir from 
the storehouse for themselves!

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:52.240
I know Shoutmon is crazy about DigiNoir,

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.230
but do you really think he'd steal?

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:58.840
Hey... I just realized Shoutmon 
and Ballistamon are gone!

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.140
Let's follow them!

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:01.690
There can be but one truth,

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:03.210
and today we will find it!

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.930
Okay, let's go take a look, Cutemon.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.750
That's the spirit!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.890
Quietly, quietly...

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:15.370
You knew Shoutmon's been up 
to no good, didn't you, Taiki?

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:16.600
No way.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:19.780
Shoutmon would never steal.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:24.140
I only came so I could 
have Cutemon heal him.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:29.510
I think Shoutmon isn't feeling well.

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:33.580
He's sneaking around because 
he doesn't want us to notice.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.130
Is he hurt?

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.210
Here I go!

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.520
Okay!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.470
Bring it on.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:45.410
Heavy Speaker!

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.110
He's training?

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.910
I get it... Shoutmon, you...

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.260
B-Beelzebumon!

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:08.810
So this is what's been going on.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.480
All of us DigiXrosing together 
with you at the center

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:14.920
was putting a great deal 
of stress on your body.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:17.480
You figured it out, huh?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:20.530
But don't tell the others 
about this, okay?

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.130
Why?

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.890
If Taiki finds out,

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:26.460
he'll feel like he can't give 
us the order to DigiXros.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.720
I need a training partner,

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.540
so I only told my best 
friend, Ballistamon.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.110
Besides, I'm the future Digimon King.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:40.110
A King is someone who struggles 
quietly, in the shadows.

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:45.620
Shoutmon, you... you 
really are something...

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:50.420
It must be guys like you that 
they call true Warriors.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.160
Huh? What did you say?

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:53.660
Nothing.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:57.000
My gun will offer you better 
training than these boring rocks.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.700
I'll reduce the power of my shots, 
and be your training partner.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.620
Really?! Thank you!

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:09.160
Hey, who's this?

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:13.090
He says Shoutmon gave him 
his helping of DigiNoir.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.630
Said "It's delicious, so 
eat plenty and cheer up."

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:16.980
I came to thank him.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:18.720
Cheer 
up!

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.450
I've finished eating it, but I'm 
going to treasure this forever.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.750
I feel ashamed for doubting Shoutmon.

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.290
Me, too.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:29.690
You knew what Shoutmon was 
doing, didn't you, Dorulumon?

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:32.670
Do you know how many times 
I've Xrosed with him?

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:33.870
I had an inkling.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.940
He's an idiot, but he's 
really quite a guy.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.790
When all's said and done, he has 
what it takes to be a leader.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:40.980
You're right.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:44.440
Let's just keep pretending we 
haven't noticed his secret efforts.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.560
Yeah. It's what they call 
a "between men" thing.

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:51.820
You're moving around better now.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.190
But it's not enough.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:56.720
Out of ten shots, I still 
can't dodge the last one.

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:59.350
If I could do that under this weight,

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.020
I doubt I'd have any trouble moving,

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:03.390
no matter how many of 
us DigiXros together.

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.370
You're just missing that last step.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:09.430
Laugh stop! In other words, 
the laughter stops now!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.110
Who are you?!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.920
Secret. I cannot tell you.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:22.170
This is Xros Heart's main Digimon? 
What a letdown.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.350
Rhythm lost! In other 
words, I'm disappointed!

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:27.620
Stop joking around!

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.190
Good bye!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.260
<i>Crap...</i>

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.860
<i>Ballistamon and Beelzebumon 
are in trouble, too.</i>

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.040
The tenth shot!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.190
I won't let you!

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:54.530
I won't let you hit my friends!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:57.120
Ouch!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.150
Jerk!

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:02.050
Ten shots cleared. 
Your training is complete.

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:05.260
That's why you did all that?

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.760
Blastmon will be here soon.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:08.930
What?!

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:11.130
Defeat him.

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.700
See you!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.600
Who was he?

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.510
Boom!

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:19.940
Blastmon!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:23.740
I found you! So it was the Shinobi Zone!

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:26.680
I knew it looked like a place 
I once saw in my minions' data.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.390
I am the final stage.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.380
Xros Heart, I challenge you!

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:35.450
Taiki.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:39.000
He sniffed us out faster 
than I expected.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.160
What will you do, Taiki?

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.900
We have to fight.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:42.860
But...

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.300
Taiki!

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.630
We've gotta DigiXros!

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.040
Yeah! I...

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:54.640
I'll always believe in you, Shoutmon!

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.140
Yeah!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.850
Shoutmon!

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:08.150
Okay!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:09.520
Ballistamon!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.090
Dorulumon!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.440
Starmons!

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:13.200
Yes!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:14.290
Beelzebumon!

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.110
DigiXros!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:18.960
DigiXros!

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:30.690
Shoutmon X4B!

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.020
What's this horse thing?

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:36.550
You think you can beat me with power?

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.460
Back! Back, back, back!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.550
Hang in there, Shoutmon!

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.220
Show us the results of your training!

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:48.760
Right!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.740
Lunamon?

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.400
That kid...

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:06.810
You did it!

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.040
Zenjirou!

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:13.720
That was a close call.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:16.050
That was dangerous! Lucky break, huh?

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.660
No, it wasn't!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.210
My present from Shoutmon!

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:21.040
It was my treasure!

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:25.000
Get up, Shoutmon!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.130
We've gotta counterattack, Brother!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.200
You want to become King, don't you?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:31.340
How do those tears make you feel?

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.100
That's obvious.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:38.110
I will protect him.

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:40.490
You wanna know how I feel now?

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:41.310
Yes!

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:44.750
I want to be stronger.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:49.290
I don't want to lose to the 
Bagra Army or Blue Flare.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:52.130
I won't let even the smallest 
tears go unnoticed.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.930
I want to see the world that 
Taiki desires with my own eyes!

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:58.030
Shoutmon...

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:01.400
I swear to you all again now.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.140
I will become the Digimon King.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:08.410
I'll be the greatest King, 
who'll never make anyone cry!

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:16.480
Same spot over and over!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:18.220
Shoutmon is amazing!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.820
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:22.490
There's no Digimon better than me

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:26.160
in power, beauty, or anything!

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:33.150
We came to help, Taiki.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:33.800
Nene!

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:37.330
Shoutmon, split up for 
now so we can become X5!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:38.590
Too much trouble!

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:40.810
Just join us now, Sparrowmon!

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:43.810
A rocker's soul is all about his drive!

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:47.550
Taiki, it's full speed ahead until we 
reach the future you're aiming for!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.730
Yeah! Let's go for it together, Shoutmon!

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:53.430
This is the time to surpass X5!

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.320
Shoutmon X4B!

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:03.180
Okay!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.400
Sparrowmon!

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:07.030
DigiXros!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.980
Shoutmon X5B!

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.940
They all came together!

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:23.280
Die!

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.090
What?! All those crystal bullets...

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.360
What <i>are</i> you?!

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:43.150
Burst Dash Stream!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:44.810
V!

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:53.940
It wasn't supposed to...

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.280
...end this way!

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:03.640
That combo attack was incredible!

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:05.320
Best combo ever!

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:08.270
Yay!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.070
Good job.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.120
You lost?

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:22.610
Do you have no regrets, Blastmon?

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:24.610
I do, I do, I do.

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:26.200
Serves you right.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:30.320
How sad to see Lord Blastmon this way...

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:34.090
Now Xros Heart has 29 Code Crowns.

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:36.700
They are now in the lead.

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.030
I will have revenge.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:43.890
How many centuries will it 
take for my body to grow back?

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.130
Hey! Tacty! Get me some of that candy!

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:49.430
Nothing but clowns all around me.

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.060
Clowns?

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:54.270
Speaking of which, I don't see 
that little "no-good" anywhere.

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:58.560
How is the Bagra Army looking?

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.080
No good! No good at all!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:03.630
Digi Ninja Art: Warrior Transformation!

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:08.940
I hear you instigated Blastmon 
and finished him off, Tuwarmon.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:09.650
Yes, sir.

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:11.030
Excellent.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:14.460
Keep up the good work destroying 
them from the inside for me.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:17.710
All right. I shall.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.860
Are you okay, Shoutmon?

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.670
No problem! I'm the 
future King, you know!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:31.440
I'm starting to think he really 
will become the Digimon King.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:33.240
Of course. I know he will.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.890
S-Someone...

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.260
What's wrong, Taiki?

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:43.590
I hear a melody.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.750
Just like when I saved 
you and Knightmon,

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.090
I can hear the sound of a
Digimon who's close to dying!

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:51.020
Where?! Where are you?!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.620
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:58.140
