00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Strong Crunch  
X-Laser</b>

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:10.980
<b>Mythical Dragon</b>

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:14.490
He'd rather work out than eat!

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Mythical</b>

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.960
Matadormon, return all 
the Digimon of this town!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.790
Then I challenge you 
to a sweets duel! Olé!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:25.000
I will never forgive someone who 
makes people who love sweets cry!

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:26.530
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:28.410
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>Sweets Zone!</b>

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:29.320
